#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:250
msgid "no views timed yet"
msgstr "nog geen weergaven met tijdmeting"

#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:251
msgid ""
"Time on page is recorded from this update on. A view reports its time when "
"the reader leaves the page, and the next run of the collector records it, so"
" the first figure appears within a few minutes of the first visit."
msgstr ""
"De tijd op de pagina wordt vanaf deze update vastgelegd. Een weergave meldt "
"de tijd zodra de lezer de pagina verlaat, en de volgende run van de "
"collector legt die vast, dus het eerste cijfer verschijnt binnen enkele "
"minuten na het eerste bezoek."

#. translators: %s: a date, such as "Oct 15".
#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:260
#, php-format
msgid "timed from %s"
msgstr "gemeten vanaf %s"

#. translators: %s: a date, such as "Oct 15".
#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:262
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Time on page has been recorded since %s. This range ends before that, so "
"there is nothing to average."
msgstr ""
"De tijd op de pagina wordt vastgelegd sinds %s. Dit bereik eindigt daarvoor,"
" dus er is niets om een gemiddelde van te berekenen."

#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:267
msgid "no views timed in this range"
msgstr "geen gemeten weergaven in dit bereik"

#. translators: %s: a date, such as "Oct 15".
#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:269
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Time on page has been recorded since %s, but no view in this range has "
"reported a time yet. Views report when the reader leaves the page."
msgstr ""
"De tijd op de pagina wordt vastgelegd sinds %s, maar geen enkele weergave in"
" dit bereik heeft al een tijd gemeld. Weergaven melden zich zodra de lezer "
"de pagina verlaat."

#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:289
msgid "not counted yet"
msgstr "nog niet geteld"

#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:290
msgid ""
"Bounce rate starts counting once the update has finished setting up, on the "
"next scheduled run or the next visit to wp-admin."
msgstr ""
"Het bouncepercentage begint te tellen zodra de update klaar is met "
"instellen, bij de volgende geplande run of het volgende bezoek aan wp-admin."

#. translators: %s: a date, such as "Oct 15".
#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:299
#, php-format
msgid "starts counting %s"
msgstr "begint te tellen %s"

#. translators: %s: a date, such as "Oct 15".
#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:301
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Visitors who arrived before this update were already counted, so bounce rate"
" starts with the first full day, %s."
msgstr ""
"Bezoekers die vóór deze update binnenkwamen zijn al geteld, dus het "
"bouncepercentage begint met de eerste volledige dag, %s."

#. translators: %s: a date, such as "Oct 15".
#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:308
#, php-format
msgid "counted from %s"
msgstr "geteld vanaf %s"

#. translators: %s: a date, such as "Oct 15".
#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:310
#, php-format
msgid "Bounce rate has been counted since %s. This range ends before that."
msgstr ""
"Het bouncepercentage wordt geteld sinds %s. Dit bereik eindigt daarvoor."

#. translators: %s: a date, such as "Oct 15".
#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "counted from %s, no visitors yet"
msgstr "geteld vanaf %s, nog geen bezoekers"

#. translators: %s: a date, such as "Oct 15".
#: includes/class-engagement-basics.php:318
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Bounce rate has been counted since %s. It fills in with the first run of the"
" collector after a visit, within a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Het bouncepercentage wordt geteld sinds %s. Het vult zich met de eerste run "
"van de collector na een bezoek, binnen enkele minuten."

