#: includes/class-health.php:81
msgid "The job that records visits is not scheduled"
msgstr "De taak die bezoeken registreert is niet ingepland"

#: includes/class-health.php:82
msgid ""
"Visits are being written to disk but nothing is moving them into your "
"reports. Deactivating and reactivating the plugin will restore it."
msgstr ""
"Bezoeken worden naar schijf weggeschreven, maar niets verplaatst ze naar je "
"rapporten. De plugin deactiveren en opnieuw activeren herstelt dit."

#: includes/class-health.php:90 includes/class-health.php:95
msgid "The recording job is scheduled"
msgstr "De registratietaak is ingepland"

#: includes/class-health.php:91
msgid ""
"WordPress cron is disabled on this site, which is normal on managed hosting:"
" the host runs it externally instead. Recording depends on that continuing "
"to run."
msgstr ""
"WordPress-cron staat uit op deze site. Dat is normaal bij managed hosting: "
"de host voert het dan extern uit. Registratie werkt alleen zolang dat blijft"
" draaien."

#: includes/class-health.php:106
msgid "Visits have not been recorded yet"
msgstr "Er zijn nog geen bezoeken geregistreerd"

#: includes/class-health.php:107
msgid ""
"This is expected on a new install. If it persists for more than a few "
"minutes, the recording job is not running."
msgstr ""
"Dit is normaal bij een nieuwe installatie. Duurt het langer dan een paar "
"minuten, dan draait de registratietaak niet."

#: includes/class-health.php:117
msgid "Visits stopped being recorded"
msgstr "Bezoeken worden niet meer geregistreerd"

#. translators: %s: human-readable duration, e.g. "3 hours"
#: includes/class-health.php:120
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The last successful run was %s ago, and it should run every minute. Anything"
" since then is still on disk and will be counted once this clears."
msgstr ""
"De laatste geslaagde run was %s geleden, terwijl deze elke minuut zou moeten"
" draaien. Alles sindsdien staat nog op schijf en wordt meegeteld zodra dit "
"is opgelost."

#: includes/class-health.php:129
msgid "Visits are being recorded"
msgstr "Bezoeken worden geregistreerd"

#. translators: %s: human-readable duration, e.g. "40 seconds"
#: includes/class-health.php:132
#, php-format
